SigenStorPanel

Shares code with SigenStorPuck (https://github.com/markab/SigenStorPuck), by the
same author. See UPSTREAM.md for which files and from which revision.

Third-party material:

- esp-web-tools (Apache-2.0), vendored under web/installer/vendor/esp-web-tools/.
- Montserrat (SIL Open Font License 1.1), subset into src/ui/fonts/.

Used, not copied:

- The EK79007 panel initialisation sequence comes from Espressif's
  esp_lcd_ek79007 component (Apache-2.0), as ported into GFX Library for
  Arduino 1.6.8's Arduino_DSI_Display.h (BSD). src/display_dsi.cpp uses that
  table through the library; no copy of it lives in this repository.
